    "design": "Within-subject randomized leg assignment (ISO vs PLY), 12 weeks, 3 sessions/week",
    "angle_convention": "0 deg = anatomical neutral (foot perpendicular to tibia); positive (+) = plantar flexion (+10 deg PF); negative (-) = dorsiflexion (-10 deg DF)",
